        "[0-2s] The girl waves at the camera with both arms and smiles. [Static shot].\n[2-5s] She says happily: \"Hi! Come with me!\" and turns toward the hill. [Slow push in].\n---\n[0-3s] She skips across the green hill, her big ears bouncing with every step. [Tracking shot].\n[3-5s] She stops and looks up at the clouds. [Static shot].\n---\n[0-2s] A small butterfly lands on her nose and she giggles. [Close-up].\n[2-5s] She says softly: \"Hello, little friend.\" as the butterfly flies away. [Slow pull out].\n---\n[0-3s] She sits down on the grass and waves goodbye: \"See you next time!\" [Static shot].\n[3-5s] The camera slowly rises toward the blue sky. [Crane up].",
