      "title": "Note: MiniMax H3 chain",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## MiniMax H3 chain — Apple Silicon setup\nGGUF model → **Parasyte Turbo** (1.5) → **AdaLN fix** (strip) → **Sigma shift** 12 / 3, sampled with **8 steps, er_sde / beta57**.\n\n- **prompts**: one prompt per clip, separated by a line containing only `---`\n- **num_clips**: 0 = one clip per prompt\n- **style**: appended to every prompt\n- **color_match** 0.5–1.0 keeps skin tone stable across clips\n\nClips, last frames and `final.mp4` are saved in `output/minimax_chain/<run_name>/`. Change one prompt and run again: only that clip and the following ones are regenerated.\n\nAfter changing model, LoRA or VAE set **redo_from** to 1 or use a new **run_name** (the cache does not track models).\n\nDo not combine EasyCache or Spectrum with Parasyte (artifacts, per the MacMax notes).\n\n## Models (~36 GB)\n- [MiniMax-H3-FL2VA-Pruned-Q5_K_M.gguf](https://huggingface.co/Abiray/MiniMax-H3-Pruned-GGUF/resolve/main/MiniMax-H3-FL2VA-Pruned-Q5_K_M.gguf) → `models/diffusion_models/`\n- [H3-PK-Parasyte-Turbo.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Plaguekind/H3-Lora/resolve/main/H3-PK-Parasyte-Turbo.safetensors) → `models/loras/`\n- [qwen3vl-32B-MiniMax-H3-Q4_K_M.gguf](https://huggingface.co/realrebelai/MiniMax-H3_GGUFs/resolve/main/qwen3vl-32B-MiniMax-H3-Q4_K_M.gguf) → `models/text_encoders/`\n- [minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors) → `models/vae/`\n- [minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors) → `models/vae/`\n\nRequires ComfyUI-GGUF (UnetLoaderGGUF, CLIPLoaderGGUF), PlagueKind nodes (H3AdaLNLoRAFix) and RES4LYF (beta57 scheduler)."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
